       |                                                                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  in call $take at stdlib/prelude.llt:2070:57-2070:76
   |
  2070 | take@[doc: "Take first n elements"]: [fn [let n@Int xs] [builtin-take n xs]]
       |                                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  in [builtin-collect ...] at stdlib/prelude.llt:2459:15-2459:35
